          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Zee Sues Nykaa in Delhi HC Over Copyrighted Songs Used in Instagram Reels Ads Without Permission",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Zee Entertainment has filed a lawsuit against beauty e-commerce platform Nykaa in the Delhi High Court, alleging that Nykaa used Zee's copyrighted songs in Instagram Reels advertising campaigns without obtaining licences or paying royalties, and seeking Rs 2 crore in damages. The case could set a landmark precedent for how Indian brands are required to clear music rights before using short-form video content for commercial promotion on social media platforms. Legal experts say the outcome may reshape compliance practices across India's digital advertising industry.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-zee-nykaa-delhi-high-court-copyrighted-songs-instagram-reels/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
